    <node id="Natural Language Understanding">
      <data key="d0">Natural Language Understanding</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A subfield and category of artificial intelligence tasks focused on machine reading comprehension, inference, and semantic understanding.&lt;SEP&gt;A subfield of NLP dealing with machine reading comprehension and semantics, specifically receiving wh-related features and canonical form extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;A subfield of artificial intelligence and linguistics focused on machine reading comprehension, intent extraction, and conversational processing.&lt;SEP&gt;A subtopic of natural language processing focused on machine comprehension of human language across various evaluation tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural Language Understanding (NLU) is a subfield of artificial intelligence and NLP focusing on machine reading comprehension, intent determination, and slot filling.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b3bf41e0b7ea425266139faf090ad226&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18770431e1f17cd9efc7aedcdb98d303&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c79b21dbff7cd9735a0e14b1f97d11d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4f9917b54f845e14e0e4edafd46cb2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b929f54fb0080794be4ecee79e383e83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Slot Filling">
      <data key="d0">Slot Filling</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Slot filling is a specific natural language understanding task where components of an input utterance are assigned semantic labels based on input-output alignment.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b929f54fb0080794be4ecee79e383e83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Emotion Classification">
      <data key="d0">Emotion Classification</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Emotion classification is an affective computing task category aimed at identifying one discrete emotional state among multiple choices for a given sentence or text passage.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b929f54fb0080794be4ecee79e383e83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Emotion Recognition In Images">
      <data key="d0">Emotion Recognition In Images</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Emotion recognition in images is a multimodal affective computing category applying deep learning to detect emotional expressions in visual content.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b929f54fb0080794be4ecee79e383e83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Emotion Recognition In Videos">
      <data key="d0">Emotion Recognition In Videos</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Emotion recognition in videos is a computer vision and affective computing task involving dynamic temporal modeling of emotions in video sequences.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b929f54fb0080794be4ecee79e383e83</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Representation Learning">
      <data key="d0">Representation Learning</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Representation learning is a set of machine learning techniques that automatically discover representations and features from raw data without manual feature engineering or lexicons.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b929f54fb0080794be4ecee79e383e83</data>
    </node>
