    <node id="GitHub">
      <data key="d0">GitHub</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A software hosting platform and organization where the authors make their experimental code available for download.&lt;SEP&gt;An online code hosting platform where the researchers published their source code and datasets.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an online hosting platform and organization where the KPTimes dataset and code repository are made publicly available.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an online hosting service and software development platform hosting the Latinolib library.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an online platform for hosting code and datasets, hosting the repository for the KPTimes dataset.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an open hosting platform where the study's code, datasets, and benchmark results were published to promote reproducibility.&lt;SEP&gt;GitHub is an open-source code hosting platform hosting the code and models for the coreference resolution experiments at https://github.com/lephong/diffmetric_coref.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f7a0c631645254ecce4e14a53d44a991&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dd9314a3266fc8d0bc21af4b765fa25b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cf0072fd347c405b3a96e6f40b88278&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f50b15c876beec2eae8bf6437e8409aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe3fb6b107774e12d36226865853669d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8c71ebe855cec9ba2150fa3ef2be8c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a91d0fd0db145647734eeea856cd2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Weka">
      <data key="d0">Weka</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A machine learning software suite whose model was used as the official baseline for the shared task benchmark.&lt;SEP&gt;Weka is a machine learning software platform and library providing implementations of various classification algorithms.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-21a91d0fd0db145647734eeea856cd2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3194fa4581f2aaec823530e030775b2e</data>
