      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A syntactic feature category (POS) extracted to evaluate linguistic patterns and grammatical structures in text.&lt;SEP&gt;Linguistic syntactic categories extracted by Tweeboparser and used to construct binary features to address vocabulary gaps.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-56672a5cb0c14c3d38c148dbe5205622&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a91d0fd0db145647734eeea856cd2e</data>
