      <data key="d0">Ablation Experiment</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An experimental evaluation conducted to measure the specific impact of removing binary features from the emotion prediction models.&lt;SEP&gt;An experimental evaluation wherein named entity recognition and relation classification models were trained separately to determine the impact of joint learning.</data>
