      <data key="d0">WASSA-2017 Shared Task on Emotion Intensity</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The WASSA-2017 Shared Task on Emotion Intensity is a competitive evaluation workshop in natural language processing focused on measuring the intensity of emotions in text, where competitors tested their predictive models.</data>
