      <data key="d0">Brazil</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">A South American nation whose national research council provided grant funding for scientific and technological development.&lt;SEP&gt;Brazil is a country cited as an example where the UN language ground-truth dataset has no available language demographic information.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-1d721fe5dad0029252753a2c12969e26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3bf41e0b7ea425266139faf090ad226</data>
