      <data key="d0">România Liberă</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">România Liberă is a Romanian newspaper whose obituaries between 1975 and 2003 were studied to examine the role and perception of women in leadership positions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a42d2500d95a11dc6c778a73c5dba9c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Sri Lanka">
      <data key="d0">Sri Lanka</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">Sri Lanka is a South Asian country where obituary language expressions and religious conceptualizations of death were studied.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9a42d2500d95a11dc6c778a73c5dba9c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="United States">
      <data key="d0">United States</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">A North American nation whose congressional debates and political landscape serve as the primary focus and dataset for ideology detection models.&lt;SEP&gt;A country referenced as synonymous with 'USA' in the manual evaluation of neural answer generation.&lt;SEP&gt;A country where major clinical datasets like MIMIC originate and where healthcare data privacy is regulated under HIPAA.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States (US) is a country where local newspaper obituaries were analyzed for gender differences in language.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is a country highlighted as an example of a nation that traditionally under-uses its country code top-level domain, potentially under-representing it in web corpora.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is a country identified as dominating many global datasets in terms of linguistic and textual representation.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is a country where studies on opioid overdose obituaries and neurosurgeon obituaries were conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is a country whose Metropolitan and Micropolitan Statistical Areas provided the geographic data and citywise Twitter corpora analyzed for linguistic scaling.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country across which 1,000 survey participants were recruited to report their weekly activities.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country targeted by the Internet Research Agency's disinformation campaign during the 2016 presidential elections.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country where the 2016 presidential elections and associated primary events took place.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country where the 2016 presidential elections and state primaries took place.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country where the 2016 presidential primaries and presidential elections took place.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country whose Metropolitan and Micropolitan Statistical Areas served as the geographic basis for the Twitter scaling study.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country whose congressional speeches and political system serve as the basis for the ideology detection dataset and analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country whose political landscape and congressional debates are studied for political ideology detection.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the country whose population (Americans) was surveyed in a YouGov poll regarding food photography habits.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States is the geographic area from which 456 million geolocated tweets were gathered between 2012 and 2014.&lt;SEP&gt;The country in which the presidential primaries took place and whose government funded the research.&lt;SEP&gt;The country whose congressional legislative debates serve as the experimental domain for political ideology detection.&lt;SEP&gt;The nation where the 2016 primaries and 2016 presidential election took place, referenced via US primaries and US presidential elections.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c17d76bd622af1c5837b2964690c50ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ae11879a44e89506f5f7277c88df7c75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b470fa40233ba7e36a9f7c70bafce9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d46bdf96e3fc5df8745fb87337fae5aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05fedd4164c9b7124d9a3db12915651a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-075e25354814630ae73f42287e577734&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1405d1609fdbebb00fe9dd18235f8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3643b20dc5e5b3d9faa14743574ec5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6493a9a6ebb59ca9af8c494e6ec25637&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b6698485050fd363980b75ae23a237b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-97953bb0d586e46165fea699da6cf781&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f602abaa7b14c1291f0ac929e87c1d7a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a22507f0961c9cfd8c5355551b99d5f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7562690242fd78972d67afd148f518b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c18ec95758198fc24e4adbe977b2a821&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ca9fdc4a98dc4d2c8f6875739e4d466&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a42d2500d95a11dc6c778a73c5dba9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06cb5cf31459df4733b688cf007ff6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb7408eee446a3d2ef83758361e2613&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-707d9bb0e2896feb599f211f8cc655a0</data>
    </node>
