    <node id="Canada">
      <data key="d0">Canada</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">A North American country and source location for crawled and annotated obituaries.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is a country displaying over-predicted languages in Twitter data relative to ground-truth census benchmarks.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is a country mentioned as an example of regional georeferencing using its country-code top-level domain (.ca).&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is a country whose newspaper obituaries were examined regarding charitable donations to dementia organizations.&lt;SEP&gt;Canada is identified as being over-represented in Twitter data relative to its population size.&lt;SEP&gt;The country covered by the obituary aggregator website Remembering.CA.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7217bed1354c5a8751d3eab9cd978cbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a06cb5cf31459df4733b688cf007ff6d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc1405d1609fdbebb00fe9dd18235f8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d7d53ab63937232bbcc4be9c7080dd31&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d721fe5dad0029252753a2c12969e26&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9645cad08b5b060013cac117d156f888</data>
