      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A document category characterized by a narratologically homogeneous and coherent narrative structure, examined for document zoning and information extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;A document genre summarizing the life, family, and funeral details of a deceased individual, serving as the subject of automatic text zoning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7217bed1354c5a8751d3eab9cd978cbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be334478ba316675f89bc24ce6e3c03a</data>
