      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A context-dependent semantic parsing dataset involving simulated environments with stack- or list-like domain elements evaluated using denotations.&lt;SEP&gt;A contextual dataset containing domains with stack- or list-like elements evaluated with denotations rather than formal query labels.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-506d24d16d4296b3078ff20115c8082b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-425ff15de9cdf497af29b3dcbbab27df</data>
