      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A broader subfield of natural language processing focusing on generating or editing text conditioned on specific constraints or attributes such as sentiment or style.&lt;SEP&gt;A subfield of natural language processing focused on guiding and constraining stylistic properties, attributes, or content during text generation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-009a3d10aa88ab09f7d1c51bd7755ef4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0e641e454fbaf0939a594969a7304c3</data>
