      <data key="d0">Bordeaux</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">A class of wines in the ontology under which StEmilion is defined as a subclass.&lt;SEP&gt;Bordeaux is a major wine-growing region in southwestern France, used in the text as both a geographic location and an ontological class.&lt;SEP&gt;Bordeaux is a prominent wine-producing region in southwestern France, referenced as a classification or category of wine.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2f9304f4481df329096caee5332f6d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fcb14d19cf40f8290f78e99be61a949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5dc202cbcb7ba0bcd01a26bba74ac644</data>
