      <data key="d0">Consumer Electronics</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A broad product category encompassing electronic devices like cameras, camcorders, and printers, utilized as a real-world e-commerce test domain.&lt;SEP&gt;A knowledge domain and ontology evaluated in the natural language generation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Consumer Electronics represents the domain and ontology category used in the second set of text generation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;The domain of electronic products modeled by the Consumer Electronics Ontology.</data>
