    <node id="St. Emilion">
      <data key="d0">St. Emilion</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">A notable wine-producing region in France, used as an example entity in sentence planning models.&lt;SEP&gt;St. Emilion (Saint-Émilion) is a renowned wine-growing region in Bordeaux, France, referenced in the text as a type of wine produced from grapes.&lt;SEP&gt;St. Emilion is a renowned wine-producing region used as an example subject in the natural language text generation model.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2f9304f4481df329096caee5332f6d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfd4e1f2af27018cbd2ff675e9601171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a1636f27f377b367415be0a5806e2aa</data>
    </node>
