      <data key="d0">LSTM-Attention</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A neural sequence model incorporating Long Short-Term Memory with attention mechanisms, used to build agent and user imaginators.&lt;SEP&gt;A recurrent neural network architecture enhanced with an attention mechanism, utilized for dialogue generation in imaginator and arbitrator components.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e97e9e342e051e03614c8dcaa59a2bbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfa367d5347172364eadcba53c1dc471</data>
