    <node id="ICD-10">
      <data key="d0">ICD-10</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">ICD-10 (International Classification of Diseases, 10th Revision) is a standardized medical classification category and terminology system used for indexing health conditions and causes of death.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Classification of Diseases, 10th revision, a standardized medical classification terminology used to code causes of death.&lt;SEP&gt;The International Classification of Diseases, Tenth Revision, a standardized medical coding system assigned to causes of death and clinical texts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f717f876f65432fa813fac20ad6a7ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0d30e05ac4755125277651156c72d63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0ced0d535e26b1f8838eba4645dd259b</data>
