      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A research initiative focused on detecting drugs in social media corpora, during which the biomedical semantic annotation algorithm was originally implemented.&lt;SEP&gt;The Drugs-Safe project is a research initiative within which the biomedical semantic annotation algorithm was originally designed to detect drug mentions in social media.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f717f876f65432fa813fac20ad6a7ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b0d30e05ac4755125277651156c72d63</data>
