      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">LadaBERT integrates weight pruning with fine-tuning to compress models more effectively than pure weight pruning.&lt;SEP&gt;LadaBERT performs iterative weight pruning on top of matrix factorization.&lt;SEP&gt;LadaBERT utilizes iterative weight pruning on decomposed matrices to reduce parameter sizes while preserving model knowledge.</data>
