      <data key="d4">25.0</data>
      <data key="d5">LadaBERT achieves comparable or superior performance to TinyBERT with much faster convergence and without costly data augmentation.&lt;SEP&gt;LadaBERT adopts the multi-level distillation constraints introduced by TinyBERT and compares performance against it.&lt;SEP&gt;LadaBERT-3 outperforms TinyBERT at a 7.5x compression ratio while accelerating training speed by an order of magnitude.</data>
