      <data key="d4">15.0</data>
      <data key="d5">LadaBERT employs random search over validation data to discover optimal fine-grained compression ratios for different layers.&lt;SEP&gt;Random search is employed to optimize the fine-grained compression ratios for LadaBERT.</data>
