    <edge source="Extractive Multi-Document Summarization" target="Summary-Level Optimization">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Summary-level optimization represents a paradigm within multi-document summarization aiming to find optimal combinations of sentences.</data>
