      <data key="d7">chunk-cdcec1aad44f0e059edddb969db938a4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Calling Domain" target="Out-Of-Vocabulary Words">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Contact name recognition in the calling domain presents significant out-of-vocabulary word challenges that require phonetic modeling.</data>
      <data key="d6">lexical recognition, contact handling</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-cdcec1aad44f0e059edddb969db938a4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Calling Domain" target="Non-Calling Domains">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Calling and non-calling domains constitute the two distinct evaluation categories used to assess recognition latency and error rates.</data>
      <data key="d6">comparative evaluation, data categories</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-cdcec1aad44f0e059edddb969db938a4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Two-Layer Pre-Initialization Mechanism" target="Multi-Threaded Service">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The two-layer pre-initialization mechanism enables the pre-composed public graph to be shared safely across all threads in a multi-threaded service.</data>
      <data key="d6">resource sharing, concurrent processing</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7994dd4a5f0c1996cedd50a0545ebc9a</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Two-Layer Pre-Initialization Mechanism" target="Data-Driven Approach">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The data-driven approach is implemented as an effective pre-initialization method within the two-layer optimization framework.</data>
      <data key="d6">method implementation, graph expansion</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-7994dd4a5f0c1996cedd50a0545ebc9a</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Pre-Composition Algorithm" target="On-The-Fly Composition">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Pre-composition prepares a shared static graph in advance so that subsequent on-the-fly composition only operates on remaining dynamic states.</data>
      <data key="d6">algorithmic optimization, performance improvement</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dacf09330ac9f65bece416e803b0daa</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Pre-Composition Algorithm" target="Two-Layered Cached FST">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The static layer of the two-layered cached FST is populated by the pre-composition algorithm before real-time decoding.</data>
      <data key="d6">architectural integration, system initialization</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dacf09330ac9f65bece416e803b0daa</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Pre-Composition Algorithm" target="Lookahead Filter">
      <data key="d4">7.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The pre-composition algorithm incorporates lookahead filters to accelerate composition and reduce state expansion.</data>
      <data key="d6">algorithmic integration, search enhancement</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dacf09330ac9f65bece416e803b0daa</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Pre-Composition Algorithm" target="Distance-Based Method">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The distance-based method serves as a specific technique for selecting states during the pre-composition process.</data>
      <data key="d6">methodology, algorithmic strategy</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dacf09330ac9f65bece416e803b0daa</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Pre-Composition Algorithm" target="OpenFst Framework">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The pre-composition algorithm and lookahead filter are implemented using the OpenFst framework.</data>
      <data key="d6">software implementation, platform integration</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dacf09330ac9f65bece416e803b0daa</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Pre-Composition Algorithm" target="State Frequency Composition">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The pre-composition algorithm builds upon earlier state frequency-based composition work by extending pre-initialization to class language models.</data>
      <data key="d6">algorithmic evolution, optimization strategy</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dacf09330ac9f65bece416e803b0daa</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="On-The-Fly Composition" target="Two-Layered Cached FST">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The dynamic private cache of the two-layered cached FST handles on-the-fly composition for personalized user dialog sessions.</data>
      <data key="d6">runtime execution, caching mechanism</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dacf09330ac9f65bece416e803b0daa</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Two-Layered Cached FST" target="State Table">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The state table provides the unified state map required by the two-layered cached FST for add-on dynamic composition during decoding.</data>
      <data key="d6">indexing, structural dependency</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-9dacf09330ac9f65bece416e803b0daa</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lookahead Filter" target="OpenFst Framework">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The OpenFst framework provides built-in support for lookahead filters during both pre-composition and decoding.</data>
      <data key="d6">framework capability, optimization support</data>
