      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Morfessor EM+Prune adapts the unigram language model and prior structure from Morfessor Baseline while replacing its search method with EM+Prune.&lt;SEP&gt;Morfessor EM+Prune is designed as an improved training algorithm for the Morfessor Baseline model.&lt;SEP&gt;Morfessor EM+Prune is designed as an improved training algorithm for the optimization problem defined by the Morfessor Baseline model.</data>
