    </edge>
    <edge source="Bidirectional Recurrent Neural Network" target="Encoding Phase">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The encoding phase utilizes a bidirectional recurrent neural network to produce contextual token representations for queries and documents.</data>
      <data key="d6">sequence encoding, contextual representation</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-f874c842ec2c36b07a6dd2abcb11dba0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gated Recurrent Unit (GRU)" target="Iterative Attention Mechanism">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The iterative attention mechanism coordinates with an inference GRU to progressively refine attention weights over query and document representations.</data>
      <data key="d6">attention mechanism, state management</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-f874c842ec2c36b07a6dd2abcb11dba0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Gated Recurrent Unit (GRU)" target="Feed-Forward Neural Network">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
