      <data key="d7">chunk-f874c842ec2c36b07a6dd2abcb11dba0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Iterative Attention Mechanism" target="Document Attentive Read">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The document attentive read constitutes the document-level component of the overall iterative attention mechanism.</data>
      <data key="d6">attention mechanism, token relevance</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-f874c842ec2c36b07a6dd2abcb11dba0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Feed-Forward Neural Network" target="Rectified Linear Unit (ReLU)">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The feed-forward neural network incorporates a Rectified Linear Unit activation function in its hidden layer.</data>
      <data key="d6">activation function, layer design</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-f874c842ec2c36b07a6dd2abcb11dba0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Feed-Forward Neural Network" target="Sigmoid Activation Function">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The two-layer feed-forward gating network uses a sigmoid activation function in its output layer to compute update gates.</data>
      <data key="d6">activation function, network layer</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-f874c842ec2c36b07a6dd2abcb11dba0</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Encoding Phase" target="Inference Phase">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The contextual representations generated during the encoding phase serve as the direct input to the inference phase.</data>
