    <edge source="Status Homophily" target="Twitter">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Status homophily was empirically measured and confirmed in the Twitter mention network using matrix comparisons and statistical tests.&lt;SEP&gt;The study detects and verifies the presence of status homophily within the Twitter social network.&lt;SEP&gt;User networks on Twitter were controlled for status homophily to determine if network connections independently drove linguistic closeness.</data>
      <data key="d6">network structure, empirical verification&lt;SEP&gt;network structure, homophily analysis&lt;SEP&gt;network structure, social phenomenon</data>
