    </edge>
    <edge source="Status Homophily" target="Socioeconomic Status">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Status homophily describes the increased likelihood of social network connections forming between individuals of the same socioeconomic status.&lt;SEP&gt;Status homophily operates by linking individuals sharing similar socioeconomic status and classes.</data>
