    </edge>
    <edge source="Status Homophily" target="Twitter Mention Network">
      <data key="d4">18.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The Twitter mention network demonstrates significant status homophily, with users preferentially connecting to peers within the same socioeconomic class.&lt;SEP&gt;The effects of status homophily were confirmed within the Twitter mention network by analyzing tie distribution across socioeconomic classes.</data>
      <data key="d6">network stratification, social ties&lt;SEP&gt;network topology, homophily verification</data>
