      <data key="d4">15.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Hindi and Malayalam belong to different language families but share lexical and grammatical similarities due to prolonged contact.&lt;SEP&gt;Malayalam and Hindi share a contact relationship and form a test language pair evaluated across varying training data sizes and domain shifts.</data>
