    <edge source="Integer Linear Programming" target="Content Selection">
      <data key="d4">27.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Content selection is one of the generation stages formulated as part of the joint integer linear programming optimization problem.&lt;SEP&gt;The ILP model jointly considers content selection alongside lexicalization and aggregation to optimize text compactness.&lt;SEP&gt;The proposed Integer Linear Programming model jointly optimizes content selection choices alongside lexicalization.</data>
