    </edge>
    <edge source="Integer Linear Programming" target="Sentence Aggregation">
      <data key="d4">45.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Integer Linear Programming integrates sentence aggregation into a unified optimization framework to avoid greedy decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Sentence aggregation decisions are integrated into the joint integer linear programming model to generate more compact text.&lt;SEP&gt;Sentence aggregation options are jointly optimized within the ILP framework to maximize information density per word.&lt;SEP&gt;The ILP model mathematically optimizes sentence aggregation by balancing the total importance of selected facts against the estimated length of aggregated sentences.&lt;SEP&gt;The extended Integer Linear Programming model optimizes which facts are aggregated together into disjoint subsets and sentences.</data>
      <data key="d6">joint optimization, compactness&lt;SEP&gt;joint optimization, text compactness&lt;SEP&gt;mathematical optimization, natural language generation&lt;SEP&gt;optimization objective, system component&lt;SEP&gt;optimization, aggregation modeling</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-99df0a2940e224839126173e8c2bc846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89649e5a10f10d3f6abdf11541607a36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfd4e1f2af27018cbd2ff675e9601171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fcb14d19cf40f8290f78e99be61a949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0a1d40aed971d10ad0f0f2c4938cf4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Integer Linear Programming" target="Referring Expression Generation">
      <data key="d4">24.0</data>
      <data key="d5">An extended version of the ILP model incorporates referring expression generation to select non-redundant names for entities.&lt;SEP&gt;An extended version of the Integer Linear Programming model incorporates referring expression generation to prevent redundancy.&lt;SEP&gt;Referring expression generation is incorporated into extended integer linear programming models to determine alternate entity names.</data>
      <data key="d6">extension, discourse generation&lt;SEP&gt;model extension, linguistic optimization&lt;SEP&gt;optimization objective, system component</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-99df0a2940e224839126173e8c2bc846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fcb14d19cf40f8290f78e99be61a949&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0a1d40aed971d10ad0f0f2c4938cf4</data>
    </edge>
