    <edge source="Message Triple" target="Sentence Plan">
      <data key="d4">34.0</data>
      <data key="d5">A sentence plan specifies how to generate a sentence from a message triple involving a particular relation.&lt;SEP&gt;Each message triple or fact is associated with a set of alternative sentence plans that define how to verbalize the triple.&lt;SEP&gt;Elements of sentence plans correspond to components of message triples such as the object or subject.&lt;SEP&gt;Sentence plans define the linguistic realization and ordering of components representing the elements of a message triple.</data>
      <data key="d6">linguistic mapping, semantic realization&lt;SEP&gt;mapping, linguistic realization&lt;SEP&gt;semantic mapping, structural planning&lt;SEP&gt;verbalization, linguistic mapping</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-2f9304f4481df329096caee5332f6d8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfd4e1f2af27018cbd2ff675e9601171&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-282fad0c34bc4ff28878e675e843b8a6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-931b1517ef4e7994e14d3ac80d1af80b</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Message Triple" target="User Model">
