      <data key="d7">chunk-623c9cfea2f0f1560eb4ea4b48d419c4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Binary ILP Problems" target="0-1 Multiple Knapsack Problem">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Content selection formulated via binary ILP shares structural similarities with the 0-1 multiple knapsack problem.</data>
      <data key="d6">problem formulation, algorithmic analogy</data>
      <data key="d7">chunk-623c9cfea2f0f1560eb4ea4b48d419c4</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Binary ILP Problems" target="Linear Programming">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Binary ILP models can be approximated by relaxing integrality constraints into linear programming models.</data>
