    <edge source="Relation Classification" target="Joint Entity and Relation Extraction">
      <data key="d4">17.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Joint entity and relation extraction solves relation classification simultaneously with named entity recognition.&lt;SEP&gt;Relation classification is one of the two core subtasks integrated within joint entity and relation extraction.</data>
