    </edge>
    <edge source="Dynamic Range Attention Mechanism" target="Task-Specific MASK Matrix">
      <data key="d4">8.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The dynamic range attention mechanism constructs task-specific MASK matrices to focus transformer attention.</data>
      <data key="d6">algorithmic control, attention masking</data>
