    <edge source="Urban Scaling" target="Twitter">
      <data key="d4">26.0</data>
      <data key="d5">Twitter activity and language variations across metropolitan areas are investigated using urban scaling laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Twitter data, including tweet volume, word counts, and user metrics, is analyzed to examine urban scaling behavior in relation to metropolitan population sizes.&lt;SEP&gt;Twitter tweet and word volumes were analyzed to observe superlinear and sublinear urban scaling patterns relative to city populations.</data>
