      <data key="d5">The researchers examine how city size and urban scaling dynamics influence the parameters and exponent of Zipf's law in social media text.&lt;SEP&gt;Urban scaling analysis in text corpora demonstrated that the exponent of Zipf's law changes dynamically depending on city size.&lt;SEP&gt;Zipf's law and urban scaling models are both employed to examine frequency distributions and linguistic patterns across urban systems.</data>
      <data key="d6">linguistic scaling, statistical modeling&lt;SEP&gt;linguistic statistics, scaling relations&lt;SEP&gt;urban metrics, linguistic variation</data>
