    <edge source="Dialogue State Tracking" target="G-SAT">
      <data key="d4">36.0</data>
      <data key="d5">G-SAT is a proposed dialogue state tracking model intended to provide fast, low-latency prediction of slot-value pairs during conversational turns.&lt;SEP&gt;G-SAT is an efficient dialogue state tracker architecture designed to lower prediction latency in dialogue systems.&lt;SEP&gt;G-SAT is proposed as a specialized neural model to optimize latency and computational complexity in dialogue state tracking.</data>
