    </edge>
    <edge source="Bidirectional-LSTM" target="Encoder Module">
      <data key="d4">9.0</data>
      <data key="d5">The encoder module employs a bidirectional-LSTM to compute forward and backward hidden representations of the concatenated input tokens.</data>
      <data key="d6">neural component, sequence modeling</data>
